# PostgreSQL and Prisma

- PostgreSQL la source of truth cua he thong.
- Moi thay doi schema phai duoc tao bang Prisma Migrate.
- Khong dung `prisma db push` trong production.
- Khong sua truc tiep production database.
- Moi quan he bat buoc phai co foreign key.
- Du lieu khong duoc trung phai co unique constraint.
- Dung UUID cho ID neu day la pattern cua project.
- Dung `createdAt` va `updatedAt` cho entity chinh.
- Dung `deletedAt` cho soft delete khi can giu lich su.
- Dung transaction cho recipe, ingredients, steps, tags va cac thao tac lien quan.
- Dung atomic update cho viewCount, saveCount va cookSnapCount.
- Tao index cho slug, status, visibility, authorId, publishedAt va cac truong search/filter.
- Khong luu binary image trong PostgreSQL.
- Dung `$queryRaw` chi voi parameterized query va khi Prisma khong dap ung duoc full-text search.
- Migration phai tuong thich nguoc trong qua trinh deploy.
- Moi thay doi schema phai co seed hoac test phu hop neu can.
